  data: {
    LLM: '1. Non-dealer leads the first card.\n2. Standard Whist rules: Must follow suit if possible.\n3. Highest card of the suit led wins the trick, unless a trump is played.\n4. Winner of the trick leads the next.\n5. **Perfect Information**: Since all cards are dealt, players know exactly what the opponent holds at all times.',
    Player: '1. Non-dealer leads the first card.\n2. Standard Whist rules: Must follow suit if possible.\n3. Highest card of the suit led wins the trick, unless a trump is played.\n4. Winner of the trick leads the next.\n5. **Perfect Information**: Since all cards are dealt, players know exactly what the opponent holds at all times.',
    objective: 'Win more than 26 tricks to be the winner of the deal.',
